# A fresh clone on Windows checked every file out with CRLF, and the repo's
# stylesheet/source-reading tests compare against literal "\n" — `tappable.test.ts` and
# `RotationPanel.test.tsx` were red on arrival in a clean HEAD worktree while green in the
# developer's own tree (steward run #2). Line endings are not a per-machine preference
# here; they are an assertion the tests make. Normalise on checkout, everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so git must not touch them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
